  "question": {
    "text": "A biconvex lens has a radius of curvature of magnitude $20 \\mathrm{~cm}$. Which one of the following options best describe the image formed of an object of height $2 \\mathrm{~cm}$ placed $30 \\mathrm{~cm}$ from the lens?"
